{"text": "From: Imogen Farquharson-Lee <i.farquharson-lee@castlegate-conveyancing.example>\nTo: Rhys ap Gwilym <rhys.apgwilym@mail.example>, Seun Adeyemi <seun.a+house@mail.example>\nCc: p.chaudhary@castlegate-conveyancing.example\nDate: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 16:42:07 +0100\nSubject: RE: 14 Bishopthorpe Mews - completion statement and funds (our ref IFL/26/01187)\n\nDear Rhys and Seun,\n\nThank you both - signed contract and TR1 received this morning. To answer\nyour questions in turn:\n\n1. Completion is fixed for Friday 19 June 2026. The sellers' solicitors\n(Tetley Marsh Solicitors, Malcolm Tetley acting) confirmed by phone today.\n\n2. The balance we need from you is £41,862.50, made up as follows:\n     Purchase price                          £385,000.00\n     Less deposit paid on exchange           £38,500.00\n     Less mortgage advance (Pennine & Wharfe)  £308,000.00\n     SDLT                                    £1,750.00\n     Land Registry fee                       £330.00\n     Our fees and disbursements incl. VAT    £1,282.50\n(I know Mr Adeyemi queried the SDLT figure - it reflects first-time\nbuyer relief for Rhys only, as Seun owned the flat in Headingley until 2023.)\n\n3. Please send cleared funds by CHAPS or Faster Payment no later than\nWednesday 17 June to our client account:\n     Castlegate Conveyancing LLP Client Account\n     Sort code 40-47-31   Account no. 61094422\n     IBAN GB90 HBUK 1941 5563 0721 37   BIC HBUKGB4B\n     Reference: APGWILYM 01187\nWE WILL NEVER CHANGE OUR BANK DETAILS BY EMAIL. If you receive anything\nsaying otherwise, ring Priyanka or me on 0113 496 0152 before sending money.\n\n4. ID: thank you for the passports. For our file, Rhys's is no. 533209871\n(expires 03/2031) and Seun's Nigerian passport is no. A09417726,\nwith his indefinite leave to remain vignette. The lender has asked for Seun's\nNational Insurance number again as the one on the mortgage offer has a\ntypo - I have QQ 12 34 56 C on file; please confirm.\n\n5. Aire Valley Removals Ltd can collect keys from the agent from 1pm.\n\nKind regards,\nImogen\n\nImogen Farquharson-Lee | Senior Associate\nCastlegate Conveyancing LLP, 3 Toft Green, York YO1 6JT\nDDI 01904 555 0117 | Mob 07700 900413\nSRA no. 648213. Authorised and regulated by the Solicitors Regulation Authority.\n\n> -----Original Message-----\n> From: Rhys ap Gwilym\n> Sent: 09 June 2026 21:15\n> To: Imogen Farquharson-Lee\n> Subject: 14 Bishopthorpe Mews - completion statement and funds\n>\n> Hi Imogen\n>\n> Signed docs are in the post (recorded, tracking no. KQ 4471 8802 3GB).\n> Two things. Seun thinks the stamp duty looks wrong - can you check? And\n> my mum, Mrs Eluned ap Gwilym, is gifting us twenty thousand pounds towards\n> the balance. Do you need anything from her? She's 91 and doesn't\n> do email, but you can ring her on 01632 960884.\n>\n> Also our new joint account for the direct debits is with P&W,\n> a/c 20817763 if you need it for the mortgage form.\n>\n> Cheers\n> R.", "kind": "Email", "detail": "455 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Rhys ap Gwilym", "Seun Adeyemi", "Priyanka", "Malcolm Tetley", "Imogen Farquharson-Lee", "Seun", "Mrs Eluned ap Gwilym", "R."], "companies": ["Castlegate Conveyancing", "Tetley Marsh Solicitors", "Pennine & Wharfe", "Aire Valley Removals Ltd", "Nigeria", "Castlegate-conveyancing.example", "mail.example", "HBUKGB4B", "York", "P&W"]}, "topics": {"places": ["York", "Headingley", "Bishopthorpe Mews"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["Nigerian passport", "National Insurance number", "race or ethnicity"], "names": ["Imogen", "Rhys", "Seun", "Priyanka", "Malcolm", "Eluned"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.30000000447034836, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90",